{"version":"v1.0","updateComponents":{"surfaceId":"gallery-local-logic","components":[{"id":"root","component":"Column","children":["heading","intro","c-cmp","c-arith","c-empty","c-update","c-checks","c-throttle","c-seq"],"align":"stretch","style":{"padding":16,"spacing":12}},{"id":"heading","component":"Text","text":"P0 验证 · 本地逻辑","variant":"h4"},{"id":"intro","component":"Text","text":"比较 / 算术 / isEmpty 打开即可见实际值。其余 case 要点击，对照「实际」是否等于「预期」。","variant":"caption","style":{"color":"basic_text_secondary"}},{"id":"c-cmp","component":"Card","children":["c-cmp-title","c-cmp-op","c-cmp-exp","cmp-gt","cmp-ge","cmp-lt","cmp-le","cmp-eq-n","cmp-eq-s"],"style":{"padding":12,"spacing":8,"containerColor":"basic_container_secondary"}},{"id":"c-cmp-title","component":"Text","text":"Case 1 · 比较函数（渲染期求值）","variant":"h5"},{"id":"c-cmp-op","component":"Text","text":"操作：打开本页即可，不用点","variant":"caption","style":{"color":"basic_text_secondary"}},{"id":"c-cmp-exp","component":"Text","text":"预期：每行「实际」必须等于行末预期。null / 缺失路径按 0 / \"\" 归一。","variant":"body","style":{"color":"basic_function_green"}},{"id":"cmp-gt","component":"Text","text":{"call":"formatString","args":{"value":"greaterThan(5,3)=${greaterThan(a:5,b:3)}  预期 true"}},"variant":"body","style":{"color":"basic_text_brand"}},{"id":"cmp-ge","component":"Text","text":{"call":"formatString","args":{"value":"greaterThanOrEqual(3,3)=${greaterThanOrEqual(a:3,b:3)}  预期 true"}},"variant":"body","style":{"color":"basic_text_brand"}},{"id":"cmp-lt","component":"Text","text":{"call":"formatString","args":{"value":"lessThan(2,3)=${lessThan(a:2,b:3)}  预期 true"}},"variant":"body","style":{"color":"basic_text_brand"}},{"id":"cmp-le","component":"Text","text":{"call":"formatString","args":{"value":"lessThanOrEqual(2,2)=${lessThanOrEqual(a:2,b:2)}  预期 true"}},"variant":"body","style":{"color":"basic_text_brand"}},{"id":"cmp-eq-n","component":"Text","text":{"call":"formatString","args":{"value":"equalsNumber(4,4)=${equalsNumber(a:4,b:4)}  预期 true"}},"variant":"body","style":{"color":"basic_text_brand"}},{"id":"cmp-eq-s","component":"Text","text":{"call":"formatString","args":{"value":"equalsString('ab','ab')=${equalsString(a:'ab',b:'ab')}  预期 true"}},"variant":"body","style":{"color":"basic_text_brand"}},{"id":"c-arith","component":"Card","children":["c-arith-title","c-arith-op","c-arith-exp","arith-static","n-now","arith-row"],"style":{"padding":12,"spacing":8,"containerColor":"basic_container_secondary"}},{"id":"c-arith-title","component":"Text","text":"Case 2 · 算术 add / subtract / multiply","variant":"h5"},{"id":"c-arith-op","component":"Text","text":"操作：先核对静态式；再点 +1 / −1 / ×2，看 n 变化","variant":"caption","style":{"color":"basic_text_secondary"}},{"id":"c-arith-exp","component":"Text","text":"预期：静态：add(2,3)=5、subtract(9,4)=5、multiply(3,4)=12。点按钮后 n 立即变，不等 Agent。","variant":"body","style":{"color":"basic_function_green"}},{"id":"arith-static","component":"Text","text":{"call":"formatString","args":{"value":"add(2,3)=${add(a:2,b:3)}  subtract(9,4)=${subtract(a:9,b:4)}  multiply(3,4)=${multiply(a:3,b:4)}"}},"variant":"body","style":{"color":"basic_text_brand"}},{"id":"n-now","component":"Text","text":{"call":"formatString","args":{"value":"实际 n=${/n}  （初始 1）"}},"variant":"body","style":{"color":"basic_text_brand"}},{"id":"arith-row","component":"Row","children":["plus","minus","times"],"style":{"spacing":8}},{"id":"plus","component":"Button","child":"plus-label","variant":"primary","action":{"functionCall":{"call":"updateData","args":{"entries":[{"path":"/n","value":{"call":"add","args":{"a":{"path":"/n"},"b":1}}}]}}}},{"id":"plus-label","component":"Text","text":"+1","variant":"body"},{"id":"minus","component":"Button","child":"minus-label","variant":"default","action":{"functionCall":{"call":"updateData","args":{"entries":[{"path":"/n","value":{"call":"subtract","args":{"a":{"path":"/n"},"b":1}}}]}}}},{"id":"minus-label","component":"Text","text":"−1","variant":"body"},{"id":"times","component":"Button","child":"times-label","variant":"default","action":{"functionCall":{"call":"updateData","args":{"entries":[{"path":"/n","value":{"call":"multiply","args":{"a":{"path":"/n"},"b":2}}}]}}}},{"id":"times-label","component":"Text","text":"×2","variant":"body"},{"id":"c-empty","component":"Card","children":["c-empty-title","c-empty-op","c-empty-exp","empty-a","empty-b","empty-c"],"style":{"padding":12,"spacing":8,"containerColor":"basic_container_secondary"}},{"id":"c-empty-title","component":"Text","text":"Case 3 · isEmpty","variant":"h5"},{"id":"c-empty-op","component":"Text","text":"操作：打开即可","variant":"caption","style":{"color":"basic_text_secondary"}},{"id":"c-empty-exp","component":"Text","text":"预期：空串 / 缺失路径为 true；非空为 false。需要区分「真 0」和「路径缺失」时先用它。","variant":"body","style":{"color":"basic_function_green"}},{"id":"empty-a","component":"Text","text":{"call":"formatString","args":{"value":"isEmpty('')=${isEmpty(value:${/flag})}  预期 true"}},"variant":"body","style":{"color":"basic_text_brand"}},{"id":"empty-b","component":"Text","text":{"call":"formatString","args":{"value":"isEmpty(缺失路径)=${isEmpty(value:${/absent})}  预期 true"}},"variant":"body","style":{"color":"basic_text_brand"}},{"id":"empty-c","component":"Text","text":{"call":"formatString","args":{"value":"isEmpty('hi')=${isEmpty(value:${/word})}  预期 false"}},"variant":"body","style":{"color":"basic_text_brand"}},{"id":"c-update","component":"Card","children":["c-update-title","c-update-op","c-update-exp","toggle","open-now","panel"],"style":{"padding":12,"spacing":8,"containerColor":"basic_container_secondary"}},{"id":"c-update-title","component":"Text","text":"Case 4 · updateData 本地写回","variant":"h5"},{"id":"c-update-op","component":"Text","text":"操作：点「展开 / 收起」","variant":"caption","style":{"color":"basic_text_secondary"}},{"id":"c-update-exp","component":"Text","text":"预期：/open 立刻取反，面板马上出现或消失，不等 Agent。顶部 lastEvent 不应变成 Agent 回包。","variant":"body","style":{"color":"basic_function_green"}},{"id":"toggle","component":"Button","child":"toggle-label","variant":"default","action":{"functionCall":{"call":"updateData","args":{"entries":[{"path":"/open","value":{"call":"not","args":{"value":{"path":"/open"}}}}]}}}},{"id":"toggle-label","component":"Text","text":"展开 / 收起","variant":"body"},{"id":"open-now","component":"Text","text":{"call":"formatString","args":{"value":"实际 open=${/open}"}},"variant":"body","style":{"color":"basic_text_brand"}},{"id":"panel","component":"Visibility","value":{"path":"/open"},"child":"panel-copy"},{"id":"panel-copy","component":"Text","text":"面板已展开（Visibility 绑 /open）。","variant":"body"},{"id":"c-checks","component":"Card","children":["c-checks-title","c-checks-op","c-checks-exp","qty-now","cap"],"style":{"padding":12,"spacing":8,"containerColor":"basic_container_secondary"}},{"id":"c-checks-title","component":"Text","text":"Case 5 · Action.checks 拦住超上限","variant":"h5"},{"id":"c-checks-op","component":"Text","text":"操作：连点「加 1（有上限）」，qty 到 3 后再点一次","variant":"caption","style":{"color":"basic_text_secondary"}},{"id":"c-checks-exp","component":"Text","text":"预期：qty 从 0 加到 3 都成功；已是 3 时再点，qty 保持 3，并 toast「已达上限」。condition 是 lessThan(/qty,/stock)，stock=3。","variant":"body","style":{"color":"basic_function_green"}},{"id":"qty-now","component":"Text","text":{"call":"formatString","args":{"value":"实际 qty=${/qty}  stock=${/stock}"}},"variant":"body","style":{"color":"basic_text_brand"}},{"id":"cap","component":"Button","child":"cap-label","variant":"primary","action":{"functionCall":{"call":"updateData","args":{"entries":[{"path":"/qty","value":{"call":"add","args":{"a":{"path":"/qty"},"b":1}}}]}},"checks":[{"condition":{"call":"lessThan","args":{"a":{"path":"/qty"},"b":{"path":"/stock"}}},"message":"已达上限"}]}},{"id":"cap-label","component":"Text","text":"加 1（有上限）","variant":"body"},{"id":"c-throttle","component":"Card","children":["c-throttle-title","c-throttle-op","c-throttle-exp","thr-row","thr-now"],"style":{"padding":12,"spacing":8,"containerColor":"basic_container_secondary"}},{"id":"c-throttle-title","component":"Text","text":"Case 6 · throttle 按 id 共享窗口","variant":"h5"},{"id":"c-throttle-op","component":"Text","text":"操作：点按钮 A，3 秒内立刻点按钮 B","variant":"caption","style":{"color":"basic_text_secondary"}},{"id":"c-throttle-exp","component":"Text","text":"预期：两枚按钮 throttle.id 都是 share、duration 3000。点 A 后 3 秒内点 B 会被丢弃，toast「点太快了」，/right 不变。窗口结束后点 B 才成功。窗口按 id 共享，跟挂在哪个组件上无关。","variant":"body","style":{"color":"basic_function_green"}},{"id":"thr-row","component":"Row","children":["thr-a","thr-b"],"style":{"spacing":8}},{"id":"thr-a","component":"Button","child":"thr-a-label","variant":"primary","action":{"functionCall":{"call":"updateData","args":{"entries":[{"path":"/left","value":{"call":"add","args":{"a":{"path":"/left"},"b":1}}}]}},"throttle":{"id":"share","duration":3000,"toast":"点太快了"}}},{"id":"thr-a-label","component":"Text","text":"按钮 A 写 /left","variant":"body"},{"id":"thr-b","component":"Button","child":"thr-b-label","variant":"default","action":{"functionCall":{"call":"updateData","args":{"entries":[{"path":"/right","value":{"call":"add","args":{"a":{"path":"/right"},"b":1}}}]}},"throttle":{"id":"share","duration":3000,"toast":"点太快了"}}},{"id":"thr-b-label","component":"Text","text":"按钮 B 写 /right","variant":"body"},{"id":"thr-now","component":"Text","text":{"call":"formatString","args":{"value":"实际 left=${/left}  right=${/right}"}},"variant":"body","style":{"color":"basic_text_brand"}},{"id":"c-seq","component":"Card","children":["c-seq-title","c-seq-op","c-seq-exp","skip","seq-now"],"style":{"padding":12,"spacing":8,"containerColor":"basic_container_secondary"}},{"id":"c-seq-title","component":"Text","text":"Case 7 · sequence 中途 checks 跳过、后续照跑","variant":"h5"},{"id":"c-seq-op","component":"Text","text":"操作：点「跑 sequence」","variant":"caption","style":{"color":"basic_text_secondary"}},{"id":"c-seq-exp","component":"Text","text":"预期：三个 updateData：写 /seq/a、写 /seq/b（checks 恒假，跳过）、写 /seq/c。实际应为 a=ran、b 仍空、c=ran。组件级 checks 做不到「只跳过中间